{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The YubiKit Swift SDK provides a modern async\/await version of the YubiKit framework, making it easy to integrate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in Swift and SwiftUI based applications. The async\/await syntax provides an easy to read and powerful way of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"creating connections and sending commands to the different applications on the YubiKey.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let connection = try await NFCSmartCardConnection()","let session = try await OATHSession.makeSession(connection: connection)","let codes = try await session.calculateCredentialCodes()"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"name":"Warning","style":"warning","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This SDK does not perform zeroization of sensitive data in memory. Cryptographic keys, PIN tokens,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and other secrets are not securely erased when no longer in use. This is currently out of scope but may be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"addressed in a future release.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/GettingStarted"],"anchor":"Preparing-your-project","title":"Preparing your project"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/OATHSampleCode","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/PIVToolSampleCode","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthnInterceptorSampleCode"],"anchor":"Sample-code","title":"Sample code"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/SmartCardConnection","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/NFCSmartCardConnecti